            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Nāvis prope prōmunturium altum nāvigat. The ship sails near a high headland."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Second declension, neuter: prōmunturium, prōmunturiī n., also spelled prōmontōrium. English promontory comes from it."
